 "logo": {
  "comment": "The logo, the mod icon and logo_animated.gif come from captures, never from drawing. crop.centre is [x, y] in capture pixels (\"c\" = middle), crop.size a pixel count or \"full\" (the full height); the square is area-filtered to 512 / 128 / 32 px. The GIF cross-fades the gif.captures (each held `hold` frames, then `fade` frames to the next, last back to first) in the same square crop.",
